    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Coming Soon .</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/cc92ecd5725f7eeaeb6d7beba353245e.poster.avif?t=1744991598\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/cc92ecd5725f7eeaeb6d7beba353245e.webm?t=1744991598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/cc92ecd5725f7eeaeb6d7beba353245e.mp4?t=1744991598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>Gas &amp; Grind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax. Build. Thrive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever dreamed of leaving the chaos behind to run your own countryside gas station?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with a dusty shop and rusty pumps \u2014 then grow it into a thriving roadside hub. Stock shelves, fuel cars, hire help, and manage your business day by day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t about fast clicks or tycoon stress \u2014 it's a <strong>cozy, satisfying life sim</strong> where every upgrade feels earned, and every day brings a little progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow-Life Progression</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your station piece by piece</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No rush, no timers \u2014 just vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Management</strong> \u2013 Balance fuel, goods, staff, and cash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Co-Op</strong> \u2013 Run the business with up to 4 friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Station, Your Way</strong> \u2013 Customize, expand, and decorate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/cab6a9c0ec47eefcf4422971326b2198.poster.avif?t=1744991598\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/cab6a9c0ec47eefcf4422971326b2198.webm?t=1744991598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/cab6a9c0ec47eefcf4422971326b2198.mp4?t=1744991598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming Soon </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Exploration</strong> \u2013 Drive beyond your station to towns, suppliers, and secret locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staff Management System</strong> \u2013 Hire, assign roles, and keep employees happy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate Contracts</strong> \u2013 Balance high-reward deals with risky consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smuggling Events &amp; Police Raids</strong> \u2013 Take chances or play it safe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Wash &amp; Repair Mini-Games</strong> \u2013 Keep cars (and cash) flowing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Markets &amp; Seasonal Events</strong> \u2013 Prices, weather, and demand always changing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/5f392215f2bd3f739c25d95e467ad688.avif?t=1744991598\" width=800 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/404b5c77e7c53787d846928a94b93a7c.avif?t=1744991598\" width=800 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/53a1d1ef7c3176fa87d186ac11e94571.avif?t=1744991598\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now, try the demo, and join us on this cozy ride!</strong><br>Your feedback helps shape the future of <i>Gas &amp; Grind</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/d37fc932bf68b170b7442f035c53bf86.poster.avif?t=1744991598\" width=800 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/d37fc932bf68b170b7442f035c53bf86.webm?t=1744991598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634410/extras/d37fc932bf68b170b7442f035c53bf86.mp4?t=1744991598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
